  "description": "The real transports and the collective algorithms of an Idrak cluster (plan 23): shared memory, TCP with a keyed rendezvous, a direct cable, host-staged and peer copies between the GPUs of one process; naive, ring and hierarchical all-reduce, all-gather, reduce-scatter and broadcast over any transport (the simulator's included), the fastest-first transport selector and the \"network\" profiler probe. Built on Idrak.Abstraction's cluster contracts.",
